  "description": "These highly regarded stocks, in a year, will plummet",
  "body_html": "<p>Sometimes, something just catches my eye, that ends up leading me 3 other directions of curiosity. And boom…there it is, an opportunity. Maybe its not what you wanted, or even expected. Its an ugly opportunity…but a chance at profit nonetheless. </p><p>Costco and Walmart…both sector leaders for retail trade (Amazon is actually the sector leader, which plays out even better for us, but they are still pretty large). This morning we ran the Short Screener on the StockTok dashboard. <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$BJ&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> stood out to me as one of the signals. BJ Wholesale has had fantastic earnings for multiple quarters, 4.4% earnings beat during the last call. But we have discovered that good news, is bad news for the asset now. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pz4d!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11889a23-1314-4d4c-854c-f2a8c6cc5c92_1548x767.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pz4d!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11889a23-1314-4d4c-854c-f2a8c6cc5c92_1548x767.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pz4d!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11889a23-1314-4d4c-854c-f2a8c6cc5c92_1548x767.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pz4d!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11889a23-1314-4d4c-854c-f2a8c6cc5c92_1548x767.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/f