for the larger companies, like BJ…who just fell substantially, -10% in less than 2 days. So we want to look ahead…what is this train dragging with it, and what will fall of the cliff later? In my opinion, that will be Costo and Walmart. I also love that I am getting some pushback. Usually a good sign (not to sound egotistical or as a know it all…anything can happen, maybe they are right). </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BfIc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b67eb9b-92a4-4a39-ad28-053e27a51bd7_763x431.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BfIc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b67eb9b-92a4-4a39-ad28-053e27a51bd7_763x431.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BfIc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b67eb9b-92a4-4a39-ad28-053e27a51bd7_763x431.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BfIc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b67eb9b-92a4-4a39-ad28-053e27a51bd7_763x431.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BfIc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b67eb9b-92a4-4a39-ad28-053e27a51bd7_763x431.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BfIc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b67eb9b-92a4-4a39-ad28-053e27a51bd7_763x431.png\" 